# {STYLE_TITLE} Design Style

{STYLE_OVERVIEW}

## Token Architecture

This style uses a three-layer token system. **Components reference Semantic tokens. Semantic tokens reference Primitive tokens. Never reference Primitive tokens directly from components.**

| Layer | Purpose | Count | Example |
|-------|---------|-------|---------|
| **Primitive** | Raw design materials (color scales, spacing steps, font sizes) | {P_COUNT} | `color.blue.500`, `space.4`, `radius.md` |
| **Semantic** | Design roles (backgrounds, text, actions, statuses) | {S_COUNT} | `color.action.primary`, `color.bg.surface` |
| **Component** | Per-component overrides (only where semantic defaults don't fit) | {C_COUNT} | `button.height.default`, `dialog.shadow` |

